# The build context for app.Dockerfile. BuildKit reads this file because it sits beside that
# Dockerfile and carries its name [https://docs.docker.com/build/concepts/context/#filename-and-location].
# Everything is left out except what the build copies, so git history, local environments,
# node_modules and the Terraform never enter the build.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/app/
!src/web/
src/web/node_modules/
src/web/dist/
**/__pycache__/
